    "en": {
      "name": "Ars Magna Artmage",
      "effect": "2+ monsters, including an \"Ars Magna\" or \"Artmage\" monster\nYour opponent cannot target your linked monsters with card effects. During your Main Phase: You can add to your hand, or Special Summon, 1 \"Ars Magna\", \"Artmage\", \"DoomZ\", or \"Elfnote\" monster from your Deck, then if you have 3 or more different Monster Types on your field, you can Special Summon 1 monster from your GY or banishment. You can only use this effect of \"Ars Magna Artmage\" once per turn.",
      "official": false
    },
